==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ms. Sign]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is almost impossible to lose; whatever units used for previous stages will work.

==Rewards==
The rewards change depending on the stage that this was continued from:
*[[CLANG!!!]]: 10,000 XP
*[[CRACK!!!]]: 20,500 XP
*[[BANG!!!]]: 40,000 XP
*[[CLINK!!!]]: 125,000 XP
*[[CRASH!!!]]: 500,000 XP

==Trivia==
*This is the first and currently only stage where no enemies other than Ms. Sign spawn.

